# Urza's Bauble: "Look at a card at random in target player's hand." The look moves nothing but it happens, and the game
# records it as Bot1's: Bot2's hand is all Swamps, so the card looked at is a Swamp whichever is picked at random. Aimed
# at its own controller the look is just as real: Bot1's hand is all Islands. Bot2 looked at nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Urza's Bauble
Urza's Bauble
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Urza's Bauble.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Urza's Bauble.Activate(Bot2)
Bot1.Hand.Urza's Bauble.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Urza's Bauble.Activate(Bot1)

[Expect]
Bot1.Looked = Swamp; Island
Bot2.Looked = (absent)
